OL,3,GNEWSACouncil boss calls for stability
OL,4,Aafter leader quits
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new acting Reform UK leader of
OL,7,FLeicestershire County Council has said
OL,8,Fhe wants to bring "stability and
OL,9,Fcontinuity" amid accusations of
OL,10,Fdivisions and infighting in his party.
OL,12,FKevin Crook has taken up the top
OL,13,Fpolitical post at County Hall after Dan
OL,14,FHarrison quit on Monday, following
OL,15,Fcomments he made about staff
OL,16,Fredundancies that were leaked online.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
