OL,3,GNEWSACouncil boss calls for stability
OL,4,Aafter leader quits
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarrison resigned after being recorded
OL,7,Fsaying 76 council solicitors would be
OL,8,Fmade redundant, branding them
OL,9,F"incompetent", before saying "what I
OL,10,Fwant to look at now is the women", in
OL,11,Fremarks which were then released on
OL,12,Fsocial media.
OL,14,FCrook said he now wanted to focus on
OL,15,Fday-to-day provision of council
OL,16,Fservices.
